summary:
  A station is listened to while it is being recorded.

history:
  A recording is a connection of its own and the one the listener asked for.
  The reading can wait for the next play; the recording cannot be taken
  again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      if (f.paused !== false || f.healing !== false || f.recording !== false) return false;

replace:
      if (f.paused !== false || f.healing !== false) return false;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_a_stream_from_another_address_an_alarm_and_a_recording_wait.
  Line-neutral.
